     "t": "Warri garee keetii hundinuu gara daariitti si in dhiibu, firoonni kees gowwoomsaadhaan si mo'u; firoonni kee warri amanamoon dhoksaatti kiyyoo si dura in kaa'u, ?Inni immoo hin hubatu? siin jedhu.",
